    "long_instructions": "**Do This**\r\n\r\nAsk the AI to help you brainstorm possible questions that can help you tell apart your two categories of images.\r\n\r\n*Not sure what to ask?*\r\n\r\nTry a prompt like this:\r\n\r\n> I’m trying to think of yes/no questions that will help tell apart images of _ from images of _. What are some useful questions I might ask?",
